  "description": "<p data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"151\"><strong data-end=\"176\" data-start=\"151\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"176\">Vulgrco is a custom sticker company built for small businesses, creatives, and anyone with an idea worth sticking. We make high-quality, affordable custom stickers without cutting corners. Whether you're branding your business, creating merch, or just making something cool, we&rsquo;ve got the tools to bring your designs to life. And yes&mdash;we believe in creative freedom, so we don't place unnecessary limits on what you can print.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"606\">\r\n<p data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"611\"><strong data-end=\"637\" data-start=\"611\">&bull; Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"637\">Vulgrco offers premium custom stickers in a wide range of materials including vinyl, holographic, glitter, matte, prismatic, and more. Every sticker is waterproof, weather-resistant, and made to last. Whether you're labeling products, decorating packaging, or repping your brand, our stickers are made to turn heads and hold up.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"970\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1010\" data-start=\"975\"><strong data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"975\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1011\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1011\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1013\">Big-brand quality without the big-brand pricing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1063\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1065\">Multiple materials, shapes, and sizes to fit your exact vibe</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1128\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1130\">Fast production times, low minimums, and bulk discounts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1190\">Designed for small businesses, artists, and brands that want more value</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1264\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1266\">Freedom to create&mdash;your design, your way, no unnecessary restrictions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1336\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1341\"><strong data-end=\"1378\" data-start=\"1341\">&bull; Payment Terms (For Affiliates):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1381\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1381\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1383\">Earn 10% commission on every sale you refer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1523\" data-start=\"1463\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1523\" data-start=\"1465\">Payouts once a month via PayPal or bank transfer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1576\" data-start=\"1524\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1576\" data-start=\"1526\">30-day cookie window for tracking referred sales</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1632\" data-start=\"1577\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1632\" data-start=\"1579\">Access to your own dashboard to monitor performance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1633\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1635\">Bonus incentives for top affiliates, including free stickers and extra payouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1718\" data-start=\"1715\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1746\" data-start=\"1720\"><strong data-end=\"1744\" data-start=\"1720\">&bull; Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"1747\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1747\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1749\">We&rsquo;ll supply promo assets, custom discount codes, and guidance to help you succeed</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1834\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1836\">No influencer requirements&mdash;we welcome creators, small business owners, and sticker fans alike</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1932\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1934\">Make content your way: unboxings, TikToks, memes, reviews&mdash;whatever works best</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2099\" data-start=\"2014\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2099\" data-start=\"2016\">We'll repost standout content on our socials and feature top affiliates regularly</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2100\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2102\">It's a great fit for people who love creativity, side hustles, and helping others discover affordable, high-quality stickers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
